From e82d885862b764318551901d64f19f24fd80ff84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Drive Player <drive-player@localhost>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:16:35 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] avi: read a chunk found without an index only as its track's
 next

Reading a file without an index, the demuxer looks for the next chunk a
track needs by walking the file, indexing each chunk it passes, and reads
the first one of a track that can take data. A file laying its sound
ahead of its pictures (an audio preload) has the walk pass chunks of
sound indexed but not read yet; the demuxer read the one it found and
moved the track to it, skipping those before: the sound jumped ahead,
and the output filled the gaps with silence.

Read a chunk found by the walk only as the next chunk of a track being
read, and only index it otherwise, as for a track not selected.
---
 modules/demux/avi/avi.c | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/modules/demux/avi/avi.c b/modules/demux/avi/avi.c
index c881aa3..a576f3f 100644
--- a/modules/demux/avi/avi.c
+++ b/modules/demux/avi/avi.c
@@ -1429,8 +1429,12 @@ static int Demux_Seekable( demux_t *p_demux )
                     index.i_lengthtotal = index.i_length;
                     int64_t i_indexid = avi_index_Append( &tk->idx, &p_sys->i_movi_lastchunk_pos, &index );
 
-                    /* do we will read this data ? */
-                    if( i_indexid >= 0 &&
+                    /* do we will read this data ? Only as the next chunk of a
+                     * track being read: one with chunks found before and not read
+                     * yet, as sound a file lays ahead of its pictures, would skip
+                     * them, and one not read is only indexed. */
+                    if( i_indexid >= 0 && toread[i_track].b_ok &&
+                        (unsigned int) i_indexid == tk->i_idxposc &&
                         AVI_GetDPTS( tk, toread[i_track].i_toread ) > -p_sys->i_read_increment )
                     {
                         tk->i_idxposc = (unsigned int) i_indexid;
-- 
